# Photography masters, never served. drinks/ and syrups/ (~150 MB of PNGs) are
# pulled from the café's Drive by `npm run media:drinks` — re-run it to restore
# them; the rest are brand masters fed to `npm run optimize:media`. The encoded
# WebP in public/media/ is what ships.
